  "html": "<div id=\"step-q93275\" class=\"step questionWidget\" style=\"display: block;\"><div class=\"questionWidget-header\"><div class=\"questionWidget-title\">Question 20</div><div class=\"questionWidget-helpButton\">?</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-text\"><p>The building model has the same ratio of length to width as a real building\nThe following table shows the length and width of the building model in centimeters. </p>\n<table align=\"center\" font-size=\"inherit\" width=\"300px\" style=\"border: 1px solid black\" rules=\"all\" cellpadding=\"5\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n        <th width=\"50%\" style=\"text-align:center\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\"> Length </th>\n        <th width=\"50%\" style=\"text-align:center\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\"> Width </th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n    <td style=\"text-align:center\">   <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"301\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c38\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>84</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>   </td>\n        <td style=\"text-align:center\">   <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"302\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>41</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>   </td>\n</tr>\n\n\n\n</tbody></table>\n\n\n<p>By rounding the given data to the nearest ten, approximate the length of the building if it is known that its width is <mjx-cont